sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant CLI as legacy_processor.py
    participant Pipeline as DataProcessingPipeline
    participant Reader as JsonFileReader
    participant Chain as ProcessingChain
    participant Writer as JsonFileWriter

    User->>CLI: python legacy_processor.py --input input.json --output output.json
    CLI->>Pipeline: load_process_save(input_path, output_path)
    Pipeline->>Reader: read(input_path)
    Reader-->>Pipeline: list[dict]
    Pipeline->>Chain: run(list[DataRecord])
    Chain-->>Pipeline: processed list[DataRecord]
    Pipeline->>Writer: write(list[dict], output_path)
    Writer-->>Pipeline: None
    Pipeline-->>CLI: processed count
    CLI-->>User: exit code 0
